        "Send Email": {
          "actionId": "sp:send-email",
          "attributes": {
            "body": "<p>Hello Jonathan Muller,</p>\n<p>$modifiedBy has just performed some modifications to the application <strong>$sourceName</strong>.</p>\n<p>Please find below the modifications performed:</p>\n<table style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\"><strong>Source Field</strong></td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\"><strong>Before</strong></td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\"><strong>After</strong></td>\n</tr>\n#if( $attributes.SourceOwner_before )\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\">#if( $attributes.SourceOwner_before )Source Owner #{else}null#end</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\">#if( $attributes.SourceOwner_before )$attributes.SourceOwner_before#{else}null#end</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\">#if( $attributes.SourceOwner_after )$attributes.SourceOwner_after#{else}null#end</td>\n</tr>\n#end\n#if( $attributes.cloudDisplayName_before )\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\">#if( $attributes.cloudDisplayName_before )Source Name #{else}null#end</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\">#if( $attributes.cloudDisplayName_before )$attributes.cloudDisplayName_before#{else}null#end</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\">#if( $attributes.cloudDisplayName_after )$attributes.cloudDisplayName_after#{else}null#end</td>\n</tr>\n#end\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>A separate approval task has been created for you in SailPoint platform.</p>\n<p>Kindly decide if to Approve the modifications or Reject them to restore the previous values.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thank you,&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The IGA Team</p>",
